  by: agent  # b78a
  actor: jgstern_agent  # b78a
  clock: 5  # b78a
  nonce: b78a  # b78a
  message: "Fixed in PR #2258. LEAK NAMED: os.environ HYPERGUMBO_SCIP_PYTHON / HYPERGUMBO_RUST_ANALYZER, written by hypergumbo_core.cli for --backend; monkeypatch.delenv(name, raising=False) records nothing for an absent variable, so the value outlives the test. A test that leaves it: test_backend_cli_flag.py (a probe test run after it in one process saw SCIP=0, RUST=1; after the fix None, None). The victims: with HYPERGUMBO_SCIP_PYTHON=1, 21 tests of test_vcs_ignored_untracked.py, test_cli_run_behavior_map.py, test_unmodeled_alias_shapes.py fail deterministically, both cases filed here among them. FIX AT THE SOURCE OF THE CLASS: an autouse fixture in the root conftest restores os.environ after every test; tests/test_environment_restored_after_each_test.py (the CLI call included) errors without it. Full run after the merge: 41,394 passed, 0 failed. GAP, stated: the exact test that leaves SCIP=1 (not 0) in a worker was not pinned; the fixture covers every test whatever it sets."  # b78a
